            <div xml:id="ch84">

                <pb facs="0598" n="478" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg478"/>

                <head>Delimitation of the Alaskan boundary</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Exchange of Notes.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Acceptance of the report of the
                        commissioners to complete the award under the convention of January 24,
                        1903, respecting the boundary line between Alaska and the British North
                        American possessions.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">[Agreement effected by exchange of notes, March 25,
                    1905.]</p>


